{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"ce2478aff14cc09f1d7261343a29166589db6180028cb9ba1a1b073d60d8113d","ja":"エミリーの買った物","zh":"艾米莉买的东西","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2cf56f0a063583859b0f65048f810d09ff130c05ad4c9cd07712a8bd959f00db","ja":"準備を終えた琴葉とエミリーは、\nさっそくお茶会を開いて……","zh":"做好准备的琴叶和艾米莉，\n立刻开起了茶会……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"aa2c2ab2dde36db9071042f922e112783490901efcf475aa6462c1fa73ab3fd2","ja":"紅茶の淹れ方、とてもお上手でした♪\nせっかくですので、冷める前にいただきましょう。","zh":"您泡红茶的手法非常熟练呢♪\n难得泡好了，就在放凉之前享用吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"27223589699e1cbecbea04ebb0e2f2396d28bcff2f1efde743d4790bb4969d73","ja":"よかった♪　えっと……ティースタンドの物は、\n下段のサンドイッチから食べるのがマナーなのよね。","zh":"太好了♪ 那个……下午茶架上的点心，\n礼仪上要从下层的三明治开始吃才对吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d04c72c97ee537363d2f3010269a5733b2a270e9a5c911f379ad8613d25d2361","ja":"あと、ティーカップの持ち方はこんな感じで……。","zh":"还有，茶杯的拿法要像这样……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"153a44591f4ebe6bf1c80b4521841d1b05cc95f614cd7cf8c3e0a1df7daaf2f0","ja":"Wow！\nとてもお上品で素敵です……！","zh":"Wow！\n非常高雅又迷人……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"037cc4e6473b00fec807df7c46df37f155f75d83fe527312109faff5a62bdd2a","ja":"ふふっ、本当？\nしっかり予習してきた甲斐があったな。","zh":"呵呵，真的吗？\n充分预习过总算没有白费功夫呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"be9c6a287479221be2cfd585d122cd84787fd98269ecb7900612695f4c2c5d62","ja":"ですが、私からお教えできることは、\n何もないような気がしますが……。","zh":"不过，我觉得自己似乎没什么\n能够教您的就是了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c9b18283b56f929b44a55236410515786b26312affd93c5e9125f7a08a32afa5","ja":"そう言ってくれるのは嬉しいけど、\nこれくらいじゃ、まだまだって思うの。","zh":"你能这么说我很开心，\n但我还是觉得，仅凭这点程度还远远不够呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b47faf3074f0a2ccbba2df89a2bbbc63a734951ab38bc5918c6b0a5b66f9891f","ja":"やるからには完璧を目指したいから。\nもっと厳しく、遠慮なく指導してくれると嬉しいな！","zh":"既然要做，我就想追求完美。\n要是你能更严格、毫不客气地指导我，我会很高兴的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3","ja":"数十分後……","zh":"数十分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f05b3f4dead286826f7f89c32016c0f285b2bea2b097d55bccc85c8589243cb4","ja":"それじゃあ最後。\n上段のスイーツ……ケーキを食べようか。","zh":"那么最后，\n吃上层的甜点……蛋糕吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5d6ad1e77442a45d7cbfc249d94d7351b641d6f62c245edd986480cff217cd12","ja":"あ、はい……………………。","zh":"啊，好的……………………。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e392af779a7db67663fb4bc4ce2d128b9fef0511d4936d39d2451592a3feb7b9","ja":"エミリーちゃん？\n私、もしかして今何か変なことをしちゃってた……！？","zh":"艾米莉？\n我刚才该不会是做了什么奇怪的事吧……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"50ff613bd28139acfb38389e5c0a5dd5be736e1f52e031792aa55d10558288bf","ja":"いえ、そんな！\n琴葉さんの作法は、問題ありませんでした！","zh":"没有的事！\n琴叶小姐的礼节没有任何问题！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"32293e4c850ad8d2cae9c1eded2f9b2812c056b738e4cde9dbae308473dc4196","ja":"でも、なんだかソワソワしてたし……。おかしな\nところがあれば言って。演技の参考のためにも！","zh":"不过，总觉得有些静不下心来……要是有什么\n奇怪的地方就告诉我吧。也能作为演技的参考！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"947437923f7a5ad26b415a5f990ef75c203cc113044803b9379777c99b5419d5","ja":"……すみません。本当に琴葉さんは悪くないんです。\n実は、こちらが、どうしても気になってしまって……。","zh":"……对不起。琴叶真的没有做错什么。\n其实，只是我无论如何都很在意……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1727.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"05900864620f34f98eb2982b68c1ca644121a5ff1ce5a210361f537ca59fb3f6","ja":"えっ、それって……桜の和菓子？","zh":"诶，那个是……樱花和果子吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
